</tr>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;"><strong>FR10</strong></td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">Perform API health check and dynamically select online or fallback store</td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">System</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<h4 style="color:#334155; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11.5pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:4px;">3.3.2 Non-Functional Requirements</h4>
<h3 style="color:#1e3a8a; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:6px;">Table No. 3.02: Non-Functional Requirements</h3>
<table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:16px 0; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;">
<thead><tr style="background:#0f2744; color:#ffffff;">
<th style="border:1px solid #0f2744; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-weight:bold;">Parameter</th>
<th style="border:1px solid #0f2744; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-weight:bold;">Requirement Specification</th>
</tr></thead><tbody>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;"><strong>Security</strong></td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">Passwords hashed using bcrypt; sanitized JSON bodies; CORS-protected routes.</td>
</tr>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;"><strong>Performance</strong></td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">Sub-300ms API response time under normal development workloads; instant UI updates.</td>
</tr>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;"><strong>Resilience</strong></td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">Graceful fallback to local mock store when MongoDB is disconnected.</td>
</tr>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;"><strong>Usability</strong></td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">Fully responsive layout matching desktop, tablet, and mobile viewport widths.</td>
</tr>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;"><strong>Maintainability</strong></td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">Clean separation into <code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">models</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">routes</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">middleware</code>, and client <code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">components</code>.</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<h3 style="color:#1e3a8a; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:6px;">3.4 Planning and Scheduling</h3>
<p style="margin-bottom:10px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt; text-align:justify;">The project was executed across an 8-week development lifecycle using an iterative model.</p>
