<h3 style="color:#1e3a8a; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:6px;">3.5 Software and Hardware Specifications</h3>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt;"><strong>Operating System</strong>: Windows 10/11 (64-bit)</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt;"><strong>Node.js Runtime</strong>: v20.x or higher (v24 tested)</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt;"><strong>Package Manager</strong>: npm v10.x</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt;"><strong>Database</strong>: MongoDB Community Edition / MongoDB Atlas</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt;"><strong>Browser</strong>: Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, or Mozilla Firefox</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt;"><strong>Hardware</strong>: Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3 or higher; Minimum 4 GB RAM (8 GB recommended); 1 GB disk space.</li>
<h3 style="color:#1e3a8a; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:6px;">3.6 Conceptual Models</h3>
<h4 style="color:#334155; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11.5pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:4px;">3.6.1 Data Flow Diagrams (DFD)</h4>
