<h1 style="color:#0f2744; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:22pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:10px; text-align:center;">CHAPTER 4: SYSTEM DESIGN</h1>
<h3 style="color:#1e3a8a; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:6px;">4.1 System Architecture & Decoupled Design</h3>
<p style="margin-bottom:10px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt; text-align:justify;">The application adheres to a decoupled three-tier architectural pattern:</p>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt;"><strong>Client Tier</strong>: A React 19 Single Page Application communicating through asynchronous JSON HTTP requests.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt;"><strong>Server Tier</strong>: Express 5 application handling security headers, JSON body serialization, routing, and controller execution.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt;"><strong>Persistence Tier</strong>: MongoDB document database accessed through Mongoose schemas, supplemented by an in-memory client store for offline resilience.</li>
<pre style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:12px; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:10pt; white-space:pre-wrap; border-radius:4px;">flowchart LR
    Client["React Client (Vite :5173)"]
    API["Express REST API (:5000)"]
    DB[("MongoDB :27017")]
    Fallback[("Client Fallback Store")]

    Client --&gt;|REST Calls /api/*| API
    API --&gt;|Mongoose ODM| DB
    Client -.-&gt;|Auto Fallback on Offline| Fallback
</pre>
<p style="margin-bottom:10px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt; text-align:justify;"><em>Figure No. 4.01: High-Level Decoupled System Architecture</em></p>
<h3 style="color:#1e3a8a; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:6px;">4.2 Modular Decomposition</h3>
<p style="margin-bottom:10px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt; text-align:justify;">The system consists of five cohesive modules:</p>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt;"><strong>Authentication Module (<code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">authRoutes.js</code>)</strong>: User registration, credential hashing, and JWT creation.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt;"><strong>Community Feed Module (<code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">postRoutes.js</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">Feed.jsx</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">PostCard.jsx</code>)</strong>: Sorting posts, handling categories, optimistic like toggling, and comment persistence.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt;"><strong>Directory Module (<code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">userRoutes.js</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">SuggestedConnections.jsx</code>)</strong>: Case-insensitive regex search across name, role, department, and company.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt;"><strong>Internship Board Module (<code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">internshipRoutes.js</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">InternshipCard.jsx</code>)</strong>: Filterable job cards with skill tags and applicant toggling.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:4px; line-height:1.5; font-size:11pt;"><strong>System Health & Adapter Module (<code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">api.js</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">server.js</code>)</strong>: Dynamic status endpoint reporting server state and database readiness.</li>
<h3 style="color:#1e3a8a; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:6px;">4.3 Database & Schema Design</h3>
<h3 style="color:#1e3a8a; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:6px;">Table No. 4.01: User Collection Schema (<code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">models/User.js</code>)</h3>
<table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:16px 0; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;">
<thead><tr style="background:#0f2744; color:#ffffff;">
<th style="border:1px solid #0f2744; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-weight:bold;">Field Name</th>
<th style="border:1px solid #0f2744; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-weight:bold;">Type</th>
<th style="border:1px solid #0f2744; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-weight:bold;">Constraints / Defaults</th>
<th style="border:1px solid #0f2744; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-weight:bold;">Description</th>
</tr></thead><tbody>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">_id</code></td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">ObjectId</td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">Primary Key (Auto)</td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">Unique system identifier</td>
</tr>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">name</code></td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">String</td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">Required, Trimmed</td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">Full legal name of user</td>
</tr>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">email</code></td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">String</td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">Required, Unique, Lowercase</td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">Campus or personal email address</td>
</tr>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">password</code></td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">String</td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">Required, Min length 6</td>
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;">bcrypt-hashed password hash</td>
</tr>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
<td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px 12px; vertical-align:top;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:9.5pt;">role</code></td>
